[node name="ManagerPopup" type="Control"]
editor_description = "Lobby 감독 modal (opened by the top-left level disc). A Control child of the lobby (not a CanvasLayer) so the lobby toast (z 5) floats over it; ConfirmPopup / ManagerTypePopup are CanvasLayers above. Hosts ManagerTab in %Body and is its host (tab contract) — own action bar %Use / %Save."
